<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11297" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαλλ-ακτέον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must release from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cor.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must remove, make away with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ἐκποδών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					6.51
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (from 
				Pass.
			) <i>one must withdraw from, get rid of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					6.8
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				66e
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
